{
    "comment": "실패한 내보내기를 같은 조건으로 다시 요청하는 확인 창. 서버는 원 작업의 조건으로 **새 작업**을 만든다 — 원 작업은\n  실패 기록으로 남고, 기준 시각은 지금으로 바뀐다(그사이 바뀐 데이터가 반영된다는 사실을 안내 문장이 적는다).\n  권한(내보내기 요청 + 원본 조회 + 개인정보 파일이면 개인정보 권한)은 서버가 다시 본다. 다른 운영자가 요청한 개인정보 작업이면\n  (서버 `abilities.retry_needs_reason`) 다시 요청하는 사람이 자기 사유를 적는다 — 원래 요청자의 사유를 자기 것으로 남기지 않는다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Export Retry Confirmation Modal"
    },
    "id": "export_retry_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.modal_retry.title",
        "size": "medium",
        "footer": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "closeModal"
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{_global.ecommerceExportIsRetrying}}"
                },
                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.common.cancel"
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "comment": "다시 요청 실행. 새 작업이 목록 맨 위에 대기로 나타나고, 목록 응답의 `has_active` 가 자동 갱신을 다시 건다.",
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "sequence",
                        "actions": [
                            {
                                "handler": "setState",
                                "params": {
                                    "target": "global",
                                    "ecommerceExportIsRetrying": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "handler": "apiCall",
                                "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/exports/{{_global.ecommerceExportTarget?.id}}/retry",
                                "auth_required": true,
                                "params": {
                                    "method": "POST",
                                    "body": {
                                        "reason": "{{_global.ecommerceExportRetryReason ?? ''}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                "onSuccess": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "ecommerceExportIsRetrying": false,
                                            "ecommerceExportTarget": null,
                                            "ecommerceExportRetryReason": null
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                        "params": {
                                            "dataSourceId": "exports"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "success",
                                            "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.messages.retried"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "closeModal"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "onError": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "ecommerceExportIsRetrying": false
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "error",
                                            "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-500 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-blue-700 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{_global.ecommerceExportIsRetrying}}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Icon",
                        "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportIsRetrying}}",
                        "props": {
                            "name": "spinner",
                            "className": "ecommerce-spinner-sm"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "{{_global.ecommerceExportIsRetrying ? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.common.processing' : '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.common.confirm'}}"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.modal_retry.message"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-700/50 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:p-4 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-col ecommerce:gap-1"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:font-medium"
                            },
                            "text": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTarget?.type_label}} · {{_global.ecommerceExportTarget?.requested_at}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTarget?.error_message}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400"
                            },
                            "text": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTarget?.error_message}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-alert-info"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "circle-info",
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-blue-500 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-400 ecommerce:shrink-0"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-blue-700 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-300"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.modal_retry.hint"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTarget?.abilities?.retry_needs_reason === true}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-col ecommerce:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-form-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.modal.reason"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Textarea",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "다른 운영자의 개인정보 작업을 다시 요청할 때 적는 내 사유 — [확인]이 본문에 싣는다",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "ecommerceExportRetryReason": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "name": "retryReason",
                                "rows": "2",
                                "maxlength": "500",
                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.modal.reason_placeholder",
                                "className": "ecommerce-input ecommerce:w-full",
                                "value": "{{_global.ecommerceExportRetryReason ?? ''}}"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-form-hint"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.modal_retry.reason_hint"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
